WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.350
Thanks for waiting!

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.520
Sorry, I ran a bit late...

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.380
Where's Jululu?

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.230
You didn't pri-ng her?

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:13.960
Well, today we have a photo shoot for the PriPara Idol Directory.

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:16.250
So I left her with Kuma-san.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.910
So where's Kuma-san?

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:23.330
He said he had something to do...

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:29.810
Kuma-san and the other mascots are
attending a special manager assembly.

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:31.630
A manager assembly?

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:32.890
What's that-pri?

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:36.400
As the Divine Idol Grand Prix is held this year,

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:41.390
they're all getting together to
share their views and discuss it.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.150
It'll be kind of weird without Kuma and the other managers-pri.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.490
I wonder if they'll decide something important?

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.250
Capisce!

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:55.040
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:57.120
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:01.330
Keep winning through the Divine Idol Grand Prix and become a Divine Idol!

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:03.870
All the other idols are amazing, but I won't give up!

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:05.870
Cheer me on, everyone!

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.560
I've got my special specs...

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:46.340
Excuse me!

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:48.350
I'm Kuma – I have a reservation-kuma.

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:52.610
Ah, yes, the idol manager party, correct?

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:53.210
Reception

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.740
We've been waiting for you.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.240
This way, please.

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:56.360
Reception

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:57.030
Reserved

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.700
Idol Manager Party

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:02.530
First Manager Assembly
for the Analysis of
Trends and Countermeasures
for the Divine Idol Grand Prix

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:04.700
We pledge:

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:09.410
that we, as the managers of PriPara, shall do our utmost...

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:14.700
to bring forth a Divine Idol and bring about the sucess of the Grand Prix-kuma!

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:16.130
What's with the hat-neko?

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:19.340
For the success of this Divine Idol Grand Prix,

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:21.200
which brings hopes and dreams to all the world...

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:23.550
Who's a good girl?

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:30.180
I declare the 107th Ace Manager Assembly in session-kuma!

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:32.800
Quit shouting, all full of yourself-ucha.

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:33.760
You're an eyesore-ucha.

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:35.610
Onto the agenda-tori!

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.010
Certainly – first up is...

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:40.030
Oh, but haven't ordered drinks-neko.

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:42.750
Andou-san, if you wouldn't mind-nekon.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:43.250
Na.

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:47.720
Poor Andou-san... He's come all the way from PriParis, too.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:48.790
So did I-tori!

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.530
Excuse me, I'd like to place an order.

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:55.330
Green juice, carrot juice,
orange pekoe with bonito topping...

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:58.270
a foxtail and Japanese millet combination, sunflower seeds...

00:03:58.270 --> 00:03:59.760
Cream anmitsu with strawberry...

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.800
Returning to the topic at paw...

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:03.760
We begin with the following:

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:08.680
The Parajuku PriPara Divine Idol
Grand Prix, bringing joy to all the world!

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:15.150
And for its sake, allow me to present my bear-illiant plan!

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:16.650
This is it-tori?

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:17.860
Your drawing is terrible-ucha.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:18.530
divine idol grand prix

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:23.100
Anyway, this is our Parajuku PriPara in full gorgeous Divine Idol Grand Prix mode!

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:24.500
Seri-usa-ly?

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:28.520
The Divine Idol Grand Prix is broadcast worldwide,

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.830
and the competitors are watching, too-kuma.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.330
And so, without being mocked...
New Yorp would have been better, na

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.500
or underestimated...

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.890
In order to live up to our forebears...

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:39.330
You're ranting-nekon.

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:42.370
We'll make it the best Grand Prix of all time-kuma!

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:43.970
How do we do that-tori?

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:44.610
Divine Idol Grand Prix

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:47.360
Firstly, we give PriPara a gorgeous makeover-kuma!

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:52.100
The fountain will cascade rainbows,
with the smell of moth orchids in the air!

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:55.340
We'll replace the paving stones with densely-paced diamonds!

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:57.610
It'll glitter in the evenings, like a fairytale-kuma!

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:00.120
In the sky, the aurora shines constantly!

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:02.910
Wonder in and between shows!

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.640
I can't believe how lame that is-ucha.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:06.740
More, amore...

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:07.810
What's that-tori?

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:10.910
Nothing at all-kuma.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.110
Take this seriously-usa!

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:13.120
What do you mean...

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:16.580
I can't believe you – a goddess is watching, you know-usa.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:19.970
That <i>does</i> sound quite lovely, though-nekon...

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:22.160
We don't have anywhere <i>near</i> the budget!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:28.210
However, what do you think of me
performing at the opening ceremony?

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:30.060
What?

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:46.700
Making Drama, switch on!

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.050
Aim for the top in dance!

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.050
On the runway!

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.670
And in singing!

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.040
Let's go! PriPara!

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:11.250
Cyalume Change!

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:18.460
It's the system!

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:00.570
Meganee's surprisingly capable-tori.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:02.510
We could do that-kuma.

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:05.380
Well, then, enjoy yourselves.

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.220
Budget, she says-kuma...

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:13.700
Couldn't we ask Hibiki-san and see what she says-nekon?

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:17.930
Good point! The Shikyouins have a boatload of cash to splash-kuma!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:18.840
Well...

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:19.460
Hm?

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:23.000
Perhaps if Ladies Falulu and Fuwari were to ask...

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:23.920
She might...

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.580
We're getting off track-ucha.

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:30.690
Item number two on the agenda! The raising of a Divine Idol!

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:35.910
Of course – if no Divine Idol is born, then the Grand Prix becomes a failure-usa.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:42.460
Though the lack of idols on SoLaMi SMILE's level is a flaw in Parajuku's PriPara...

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:43.540
Huh?

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.220
Say that again to my face-usa!

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:48.490
I'm not letting that pass just because it's some moron's drivel-ucha!

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:50.010
Exactly!

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:53.200
There are other worthy contenders, you know-nekon.

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:58.860
Strange, I don't recall there being any other idols capable of pulling this show.

00:08:58.860 --> 00:09:01.570
Nope, doesn't ring a bell-kuma.

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:03.140
And why is that?

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:05.770
Sophie, with a cool character!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:06.740
Fi!

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:08.830
The original sentence ender-user, Mirei!

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:10.450
Mi, Mi!

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:14.100
And the one who's spread "Capisce" as a lingua franca worldewide!

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:15.220
Lala!

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:16.800
Mama!

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:22.620
The three together are SoLaMi SMILE, the super idols closer than anyone to becoming Divine Idols-kuma!

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:25.340
Usa, usa!

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:29.690
If you're talking character, how about the girl who
hit the ground running and hasn't stopped, Dorothy!

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:31.160
Doro!

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:34.270
And probably the cutest in all of PriPara,

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:35.870
everyone's favourite, Reona!

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:36.910
Re, Re!

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:39.210
I can't argue with that-kuma...

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:42.620
And the handsome, cool idol Shion!

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:43.940
Shi-shi!

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:47.850
You can't compare any other unit to Dressing Pafé when it comes to character-usa!

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:49.980
Neko-ko-ko-ko!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:51.550
"Character"?

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:54.910
There's no other than Garumageddon!

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:56.850
The demon Aroma...

00:09:56.850 --> 00:09:58.720
The angel Mikan...

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.700
And the beast Garuru!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:03.890
They've transcended your idols' humanity-neko.

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:07.070
And they're the most popular with kids, too!

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:09.080
That does seem to be the case-usa...

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:11.200
Ucha-cha-cha-cha-cha!

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:16.060
You'd best not forget my Non,
youngest and cleverest of all-ucha!

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:20.920
Her secret was revealed in the end,
but Triangle caused a stir like no other!

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:23.760
Or how about that cutest and much-discussed manager...

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.660
What's that now?

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:28.530
I might just make a team with Non and become an idol myself-ucha!

00:10:28.530 --> 00:10:29.550
Got for it, Usacha!

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:31.260
With an... "Ucha-pero"!

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:32.880
This could work-ucha!

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:33.820
No way!

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:38.990
Lala's idol power is inconsistent-usa!

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:42.820
Shion kicked in a camera during her song –
there's no way that's allowed-neko!

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:46.030
Reona looks too darn good in a skirt-kuma!

00:10:46.030 --> 00:10:49.210
Dorothy keeps getting in my idol's way-ucha!

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:51.690
Calm down, everybody.

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:53.070
Let's get along.

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:59.550
Well, if you ask the manager who turned Hibiki, Falulu and Fuwari into a great success,

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:03.740
this squabble amongst commoners isn't worth getting involved in-tori!

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:05.220
Who're you calling a commoner?

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.900
PriPara-ding-dong!

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:13.260
We have many complaints from our viewers to present!

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:15.480
52 viewers say "get on with it".

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:17.560
20 viewers say "quit messing around".

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:19.390
8 viewers say "Usacha so cute".

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:21.260
3 viewers say "Say something, Ham-sen–"

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:24.670
You want proof of SoLaMi SMILE's superiority?

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:27.960
We can wipe the floor with you even
taking the "So" out of "SoLaMi"-kuma!

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:29.580
What's that now?

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:32.690
Making Drama, switch on!

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:40.490
Yay!

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:00.640
Fresh...

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:02.350
Sweets Park!

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:06.660
Cyalume Change!

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:13.450
Pri!

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.710
Oh, that takes me back-kuma...

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:38.540
I can't deny its excellence-usa...

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:41.260
So, returning to the matter from earlier.

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:42.420
The complaint line...

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.380
What?

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:44.800
We're being broadcast-usa?

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:47.380
Yes! Live from PriPara satellite feed!

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:55.430
Firstly, I would like to express our earnest gratitude to all viewers for their gracious support-kuma.

00:13:56.160 --> 00:14:00.050
We understand that we have betrayed this goodwill,

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:04.900
and we must express our sorrow for this from the bottom of our hearts-kuma.

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.220
It is simple enough to say so,

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:10.030
but we can only seek to express our sincerest apologies...

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:13.770
and pledge to not allow this to happen again-usa.

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:15.320
We're very sorry.

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:30.920
Well, then, we had an... <i>eventful</i> first half,

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:35.630
but let's change gears and have a productive rest of the meeting!

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:36.900
Yay!

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:43.150
Da Vinci! Vinci! Vinci!

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:46.260
My glasses have vanished into the easel and I can't see a thing!

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:49.620
My glasses! My glasses...

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:53.450
Ham-senpai, do you remembrandt where I left them?

00:14:58.360 --> 00:15:00.290
Wow! Why were they were under there?

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.290
"I saw them fall down before..."

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.250
"... when you were playing with Jululu."

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:06.010
I see, when I was playing with little Jululu earlier.

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:09.560
Gouache-ias, gouache-ias!
Now there's nothing I can't per-euvens!

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:14.450
Now, then, this here Kiki Ajimi's gonna aim for Divine Idol as well-Da Vinci!

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:15.930
What?

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:27.290
Da Vinci!

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:30.630
Making Drama, switch on!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.310
Snip-snip!

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:42.210
It's finished!

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:46.350
Snip-snip Stuffed Animal Kingdom!

00:16:48.350 --> 00:16:51.840
Cyalume Change!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:28.180
Oho? Is little Jululu be-Kooning Ponkan's fan?

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:32.040
I'm over the Munch! I'm over the Munch!

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:35.740
Ponkan loves you too, little Dalíng!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:39.010
Where do you Corin-think I can find Little Curly?

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:40.490
Eh–err–uh–um...

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:42.000
That she was filming at the North Pole...

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:43.140
Little Curly!

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.930
... would be a lie.

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:45.130
Little Curly!

00:17:47.530 --> 00:17:49.880
We're not losing to SoLaMi or Garumageddon-usa!

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.200
Non's becoming a Divine Idol-ucha!

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:53.050
SoLaMi!
Garumageddon!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:53.610
DrePa!
Garumageddon!

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:54.100
Tori!

00:17:56.140 --> 00:18:00.440
None of the Parajuku teams can hold a candle to PriParis's hottest act-tori!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:04.160
Oh, no, I don't think I can handle being happy-tori!

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:05.770
Chan-ko! Chan-ko!

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:07.620
Say, this chanting couldn't be...

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:10.140
I've got one more complaint for you-chanko!

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:12.520
She's back after reaching new heights in New Yorp...

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:13.340
Chan-ko! Chan-ko!

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:16.060
I'm going to be a Divine Idol-chanko!

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:19.930
Chan-ko! Chan-ko!

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:21.910
Dosukoi!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:25.810
Chanko's performance is making its TV début!

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:27.870
Watch and be amazed-chanko.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:18.510
Hmph! Come on!

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:22.430
Chanko!

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:25.260
Making Drama, switch on!

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:29.520
Chanko!

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:34.170
Chan-ko!

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:45.250
Cha... n... ko!

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.120
Let's dig in!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:51.400
Walloping seafood chanko nabe!

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:53.400
I will beat up gaaru no honnou
I will smack them down; don't underestimate me

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:55.370
Muchas gracias!

00:19:55.370 --> 00:19:55.400
amai wake nai jan
This girl's fighting instincts are sharp

00:19:55.400 --> 00:19:56.040
This girl's fighting instincts are sharp
amai wake nai jan

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:58.610
I'll be countin' on ya-chanko.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:07.940
Well, anyway, there are plenty of paw-ful rivals out there!

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:13.700
Let's aim for Divine Idol and do our best-kuma!

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:14.690
Right-usa!

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:15.460
Ucha!

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:17.880
Rivals or not, we'll all put our best paws forward!

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:23.390
Hibiki-sama and Ladies Falulu and Fuwari will depart PriParis shorty...

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:26.840
