00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:27.720
Indeed-tori!

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.560
What's that now?

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:32.460
Things are really coming to a boil-kuma!

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:33.320
Yeah!

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:34.860
Hey, it's Kuma-pri.

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:36.940
I didn't expect to see you here.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:38.150
What are you doing here?

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:39.690
Mama!

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:41.290
Jululu!

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:44.140
Were you a good girl?

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:47.740
Your timing couldn't be better-kuma.

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:50.620
Let's get fired up and aim for Divine Idol-kuma!

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:52.570
Get... fired up?

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:55.420
The Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:21:56.610 --> 00:22:00.330
Why, that's the shining star of our hopes and dreams!

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:02.380
Go for it!

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:03.480
Yeah!

00:22:03.480 --> 00:22:04.600
Go for it!

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:05.850
Yeah!

00:22:05.850 --> 00:22:08.300
Please pay for the wall you destroyed.

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:09.630
We're sorry!

00:22:09.630 --> 00:22:11.440
We had nothing to do with it!

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:13.250
Go for it!

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:14.410
Yeah!

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:15.680
Compensation!

